  "reasoning": "The defendant unlawfully accessed a bank's self-service cash machine using a stolen key and known password, and took cash amounting to 352,600 yuan. This constitutes taking another's property by force or stealth without any legitimate authority, which matches the definition of theft (盗窃). No other distinct illegal conduct (e.g., fraud, embezzlement, or abuse of official position) is evident, so the appropriate charge is 盗窃.",
